Push channel levels, and an optional picture on a push.

Base: zan-workspace main at d050b94 (native-push.patch, committed).
Apply from the web repo root:
    git apply --check push-channel-levels.patch
    git apply push-channel-levels.patch

What it changes:
- src/constants/pushChannels.ts: New leads and New clients and projects become URGENT (sound and
  a pop-up). Stage changes, Notes, Logged calls and Documents become DEFAULT (sound, no pop-up).
  No channel is SILENT now. The phone copies this file unchanged.
- sendPush passes the rendered message's imageUrl to the phone as data.imageUrl. The phone shows
  it as the round picture on the right of the notification. No renderer sets imageUrl today, so no
  push carries a picture yet.

Effect on browsers: none. On iPhones (later): every channel now plays a sound ("active").

